        "question_text": "<p>A club has the following receipts and payments for the year:<br>- Subscriptions received: \u20b512,000<br>- Rent paid: \u20b53,000<br>- Salaries paid: \u20b54,000<br>- Donations received: \u20b52,000<br><br>What is the surplus or deficit for the year?</p>",
